#: ../guide/commissions.md:1 9cc2b1923eb3444ca2fd4fb6b35e9a09
msgid "Commissions and slippage"
msgstr "佣金与滑点"

#: ../guide/commissions.md:3 0b6bf192ef0340a69a460e10ce53e9a7
msgid ""
"QTrade ships four `Commission` implementations covering the patterns most"
" strategies need. All live in `qtrade.core.commission` and share the "
"abstract base `Commission`."
msgstr ""
"QTrade 内置四种 `Commission` 实现，覆盖大多数策略需要的模式。"
"全部位于 `qtrade.core.commission`，共享抽象基类 `Commission`。"

#: ../guide/commissions.md:16 149cb340ca8740d78523c0da4162bf95
msgid ""
"Pass an instance to `Backtest(..., commission=...)` or `TradingEnv(..., "
"commission=...)`. `commission=None` is equivalent to `NoCommission()`."
msgstr ""
"把实例传给 `Backtest(..., commission=...)` 或 `TradingEnv(..., commission=...)`。"
"`commission=None` 等价于 `NoCommission()`。"

#: ../guide/commissions.md:20 ae378138f40e4cf5b2a0d4b2bbd54c25
msgid "The interface"
msgstr "接口"

#: ../guide/commissions.md:22 0195556d9fc54bed8a271a24d18b45da
msgid ""
"`Commission.calculate_commission(order_size: int, fill_price: float) -> "
"float`"
msgstr ""
"`Commission.calculate_commission(order_size: int, fill_price: float) -> float`"

#: ../guide/commissions.md:24 9fa182c2f2924602be8e0234bb47e768
msgid ""
"Returns the commission in account currency for a single fill. The Broker "
"subtracts it from `cash` at fill time. Sign of `order_size` is preserved "
"— use `abs(order_size)` inside if you want symmetric fees on buys and "
"sells."
msgstr ""
"返回一笔成交的佣金（账户币种）。Broker 在成交时从 `cash` 扣除。"
"`order_size` 的符号保留 —— 如果想买卖对称收费，在内部用 `abs(order_size)`。"

#: ../guide/commissions.md:29 7eab0e478d214778af61e6854e7ce164
msgid "To roll your own:"
msgstr "自定义实现："

#: ../guide/commissions.md:43 66a6132aa9264c93aa3d6c477b87f773
msgid "Built-in implementations"
msgstr "内置实现"

#: ../guide/commissions.md:45 b7d01575197644a0b621aaff022cd54f
msgid "NoCommission"
msgstr "NoCommission"

#: ../guide/commissions.md:51 2d0d1704230c40479d9293757637049a
msgid ""
"Returns `0.0` always. The default if you don't pass anything. Use it for "
"clean comparisons against Buy & Hold, or when modeling commission-free "
"brokers."
msgstr ""
"始终返回 `0.0`。不传任何参数时的默认值。用于和 Buy & Hold 做干净对比，"
"或者建模零佣金券商。"

#: ../guide/commissions.md:55 3b3f5f0724f8483a875f09308fa1f468
msgid "PercentageCommission"
msgstr "PercentageCommission"

#: ../guide/commissions.md:61 b3519dbea7ee49348f10b015ede3903b
msgid "Charges `abs(order_size) * fill_price * percentage`."
msgstr "按 `abs(order_size) * fill_price * percentage` 收费。"

#: ../guide/commissions.md:63 082f82db95174cbe9373aa0b4da36666
msgid ""
"The standard model for **stocks** (commissions quoted as bps of notional)"
" and **crypto spot** (taker fees are typically 0.05–0.1%)."
msgstr ""
"**股票**（佣金按名义本金的 bps 报价）和**加密现货**（taker 费率通常 0.05–0.1%）"
"的标准模型。"

#: ../guide/commissions.md:66 de0be0bea8c64ea0ba8df3038630995a
msgid "FixedCommission"
msgstr "FixedCommission"

#: ../guide/commissions.md:72 07839273f9b14af4a1d1d269ac0d9300
msgid ""
"Returns a flat fee regardless of size or price. Realistic for **futures**"
" (where the exchange charges per-contract) and for **discount brokers** "
"that quote a flat ticket charge."
msgstr ""
"无论 size 和价格如何，返回固定费用。适合 **期货**（交易所按合约计费）和"
"按笔收单一费用的**折扣券商**。"

#: ../guide/commissions.md:76 6e221c0aa3624645ac005b2219579595
msgid ""
"For futures with multiple commission components (exchange + clearing + "
"broker), sum them up: `FixedCommission(fixed_fee=2.50)`."
msgstr ""
"对于含多个佣金组件（交易所 + 清算 + 券商）的期货，加总后传入："
"`FixedCommission(fixed_fee=2.50)`。"

#: ../guide/commissions.md:79 8307916f17aa46369bb0c648a719cdb4
msgid "SlippageCommission"
msgstr "SlippageCommission"

#: ../guide/commissions.md:85 fe73250a09c54050887e9f3c1cfa88c1
msgid ""
"Mathematically identical to `PercentageCommission`, but the intent is "
"different — this models the *price impact* of crossing the spread, not a "
"venue fee. Use it when:"
msgstr ""
"数学上与 `PercentageCommission` 相同，但意图不同 —— 这个建模的是穿越买卖价差的"
"*价格冲击*，不是交易所费用。适用场景："

#: ../guide/commissions.md:89 42ed7965fa2a4a9db1091d4f65ca400a
msgid "You want to add slippage **on top of** an explicit commission."
msgstr "想在显式佣金**之上**额外加上滑点。"

#: ../guide/commissions.md:90 c86e86351f6e43a089ca12477d998d83
msgid ""
"You want the cost to scale with notional but separate from \"fees\" in "
"reporting."
msgstr ""
"想让成本按名义本金缩放，但在报表中和「佣金」分开统计。"

#: ../guide/commissions.md:104 7ef9c391a676427eb4d954807c0db30d
msgid "Picking the right model"
msgstr "如何选择合适的模型"

#: ../guide/commissions.md 8e7193a1595f41749cd11cdf8723022b
msgid "Asset class"
msgstr "资产类别"

#: ../guide/commissions.md 12ca2a1df25e431686ea1ddcc2402842
msgid "Typical setup"
msgstr "典型设置"

#: ../guide/commissions.md 55b22e22c37d4509a9675d24f377befb
msgid "US equities (retail)"
msgstr "美股（零售）"

#: ../guide/commissions.md 6976ad12d9e6443a81d353951638b946
msgid "`NoCommission()` (most brokers are zero now) + small `SlippageCommission`"
msgstr "`NoCommission()`（大多数券商已零佣）+ 小额 `SlippageCommission`"

#: ../guide/commissions.md f49cf1f127c2484aa5393e69066a61f7
msgid "US equities (institutional)"
msgstr "美股（机构）"

#: ../guide/commissions.md df8607371dbc4bbab24ddff2667cb0f0
msgid "`PercentageCommission(0.0005)` (~5 bps blended)"
msgstr "`PercentageCommission(0.0005)`（综合约 5 bps）"

#: ../guide/commissions.md 4bfeba29d46843ccae48bc31a35b2cea
msgid "Futures"
msgstr "期货"

#: ../guide/commissions.md 4d2c9c6eab4d447c89b168e19417cbb0
msgid "`FixedCommission(2.5)` per contract + slippage"
msgstr "`FixedCommission(2.5)` 每合约 + 滑点"

#: ../guide/commissions.md 8d2f29b46f5c4d81a508b12a1aa95ac4
msgid "FX"
msgstr "外汇"

#: ../guide/commissions.md 663a48ff72bf4cf496c66409b43b70f5
msgid "`PercentageCommission(0.0001)` (1 pip on majors)"
msgstr "`PercentageCommission(0.0001)`（主要货币对约 1 个点）"

#: ../guide/commissions.md e6b7f91e24d047ca8df695e88e8e7554
msgid "Crypto spot"
msgstr "加密现货"

#: ../guide/commissions.md 3d5f37477fe847c8b53e39d712795153
msgid "`PercentageCommission(0.001)` (taker) or `(0.0005)` (maker)"
msgstr "`PercentageCommission(0.001)`（taker）或 `(0.0005)`（maker）"

#: ../guide/commissions.md 34761751a66249e7be655b9f2284a995
msgid "Crypto perps"
msgstr "加密永续合约"

#: ../guide/commissions.md a2b03bda858b4599bfb0710339e9684e
msgid "`PercentageCommission(0.0005)` taker + funding (modeled separately)"
msgstr "`PercentageCommission(0.0005)` taker + 资金费率（单独建模）"

#: ../guide/commissions.md:115 1f251258cf944c9192cb3c6d20491069
msgid ""
"If unsure, **run the backtest both with and without commission**. The gap"
" tells you how cost-sensitive your strategy is — high-turnover strategies"
" often look great pre-cost and lose money post-cost."
msgstr ""
"不确定的话，**回测时分别带和不带佣金跑一遍**。差距告诉你策略的成本敏感度 —— "
"高换手率策略经常成本前看起来很美，扣掉成本就亏钱。"

#: ../guide/commissions.md:119 3969a8a232494872884d4a2fa80d7b4e
msgid "What's not modeled"
msgstr "未建模的部分"

#: ../guide/commissions.md:121 644e4edbf87d4ac0821b498457f9c723
msgid ""
"**Maker/taker asymmetry.** All fills are charged at one rate. To model "
"maker fees on limit orders, write a custom `Commission` and branch on "
"whether the order has a `limit` price."
msgstr ""
"**Maker / taker 不对称**。所有成交按单一费率收费。如需对限价单按 maker 费率收费，"
"写一个自定义 `Commission` 并根据订单是否有 `limit` 价格分支。"

#: ../guide/commissions.md:124 e42f3012317d45478cd504a7ab793e06
msgid ""
"**Spread.** The Broker fills market orders at `Close` (or next `Open`). "
"The bid/ask spread isn't modeled — `SlippageCommission` is the closest "
"approximation."
msgstr ""
"**买卖价差**。Broker 用 `Close`（或下一根 `Open`）成交市价单。"
"买卖价差未建模 —— `SlippageCommission` 是最接近的近似。"

#: ../guide/commissions.md:127 523836eb5ad248f7be0cdadf50142462
msgid ""
"**Funding rates / borrow costs.** Not modeled. For long-running short "
"positions or perp funding, you'd need to subtract from `cash` manually in"
" your strategy's `on_bar_close`."
msgstr ""
"**资金费率 / 借券成本**。未建模。对于长期空仓或永续合约资金费率，需要在策略的 "
"`on_bar_close` 里手动扣 `cash`。"

#: ../guide/commissions.md:130 dc40a1e528ab419bbec9d84104884f94
msgid ""
"**Per-asset commission.** A single `Commission` instance applies to all "
"assets in a multi-asset backtest. If you need different rates per asset, "
"write a custom `Commission` that branches on the order's `_fill_price` or"
" wrap it in your strategy logic."
msgstr ""
"**按资产收费**。多资产回测中单个 `Commission` 实例应用到所有资产。"
"如需按资产差异化费率，写一个根据订单 `_fill_price` 分支的自定义 `Commission`，"
"或在策略逻辑里包装。"
